<task id="090" project="email-communication-intelligence-r1">
  <metadata>
    <title>Project wrap-up — README/status → Complete + 9 Success Criteria annotated, `/test-diet` gate, lessons-learned, TASK-INDEX reconciliation</title>
    <phase>Wrap</phase>
    <gate>done</gate>
    <status>not-started</status>
    <tags>wrapup</tags>
    <rigor>MINIMAL</rigor>
    <rigor-reason>Project-close orchestration from the MAIN SESSION: status flip + 9 Success Criteria annotation, lessons-learned, the mandatory `/test-diet` reconciliation gate (root §7), and TASK-INDEX reconciliation. Writes project-close state + invokes the test-diet gate; no product code change. MINIMAL rigor with the explicit test-diet gate.</rigor-reason>
    <model-tier>sonnet</model-tier>
    <model-tier-reason>Documentation + gate orchestration against a known close-out sequence; no design judgment.</model-tier-reason>
