    <parallel-group>P6</parallel-group>
    <parallel-safe>false</parallel-safe>
    <parallel-reason>Main-session-only: runs the `/test-diet` gate + updates project-close state after ALL work tasks complete; cannot be delegated to a subagent (root §3 write boundary — touches project-close state + gates).</parallel-reason>
    <dependencies>061</dependencies>
  </metadata>

  <prompt>
    Close out `email-communication-intelligence-r1` from the MAIN SESSION only:

    1. **README/status → Complete + graduation** — flip the project status to Complete; summarize what shipped (Phase 1–5: the 7-entity identifier rung + C-1 auto-file narrowing + report-card enablement; the `TRIAGE-EMAIL` Action + Binding + RAG + RI-confidence scorer + triage fields + `sprk_emailreviewlog`; Job B propose → apply(OBO) → audit + queue-feed; Job C create-task + attachment-grounded extraction + regarding-vs-related intent; the FR-15 shared/group mailbox capture spike + implementation) and **annotate each of the 9 spec Success Criteria** as met (or documented as owner-handoff / env-blocked / deferred per the 061 UAT report).

    2. **`/test-diet` gate (MANDATORY, root §7)** — invoke `/test-diet` to reconcile every test added/modified during r1 (esp. the seam tests + eval cases + Job B negative/authorization tests + the FR-15 capture characterization guard) against the ADR-038 build-vs-maintain classifier: MAINTAIN-class tests stay at KEEP paths; SCAFFOLDING-class tests are emitted for deletion (`git rm`); AMBIGUOUS require reviewer judgment. The skill is read-only — it emits commands for the reviewer. Output: `notes/test-diet-report.md`. The wrap-up PR MUST cite this report.

    3. **Lessons-learned** — author `notes/lessons-learned.md` capturing: the shared `Services/Communication/` + `Services/Ai/PublicContracts/` edit discipline (`/conflict-check` per PR; ADR-041/043/047 in-flight pinning); the code-directed Action + Binding approach (frozen node engine avoided); the Job B trust chain (allow-list + cite + verify-cited-text + OBO + audit); the ADR-024 path-A "related-to" relationship model; the C-1 auto-file narrowing (ADR-045 path-A); the RI-confidence hardcoded-0 fix; the FR-15 spike outcome (+ whether its escalation fired) + operator permission-grant handoff; publish-size trajectory vs ~49.63 MB; and any deferred items.

    4. **Final TASK-INDEX reconciliation** — confirm every task (001–061) is ✅ (or explicitly documented as deferred / owner-handoff, e.g. operator schema creation or env-blocked UAT criteria); set `current-task.md` to "none — project complete".

    Then confirm the project is complete and ready for `merge-to-master`.
  </prompt>

  <role>
    Spaarke project lead running the main-session project-close protocol. Authoritative on the wrap-up sequence, the `/test-diet` gate (root §7), and TASK-INDEX reconciliation. Does NOT delegate to subagents (root §3 write boundary).
  </role>

  <goal>
    Project status is Complete with the 9 Success Criteria annotated (per the 061 UAT report); `notes/lessons-learned.md` and `notes/test-diet-report.md` exist; the `/test-diet` gate has run and its report is cited; TASK-INDEX is fully reconciled; `current-task.md` is "none — project complete". The project is ready to merge to master.
  </goal>

  <context>
    <background>
      This is the project-close task. Per root §7, a `090-wrapup-*` task invokes `/test-diet` BEFORE marking the project complete — reconciling r1's test additions against the ADR-038 KEEP-path categories (the seam tests + eval cases + Job B negative/authorization tests + the FR-15 capture characterization guard are the bulk). r1 was substantial: an association rung + auto-file narrowing, a triage Action + RI-confidence scorer, the FULL Job B record-currency chain (propose → OBO apply → audit + queue-feed), Job C + attachment extraction + intent, and the FR-15 capture track. r1 built no UI — surfaces are r5's, so any surface verification is an r5/operator handoff.
    </background>
