  <constraints>
    <constraint source="root §7">A `090-wrapup-*` task MUST invoke `/test-diet` BEFORE marking the project complete; the wrap-up PR MUST cite `notes/test-diet-report.md` (or document the skip rationale). Skipping is a HARD WARNING.</constraint>
    <constraint source="root §3">Main-session only — this task writes project-close state + runs the gate; do NOT delegate to a subagent.</constraint>
    <constraint source="ADR-038">`/test-diet` classifies per the build-vs-maintain criteria; the skill is read-only (emits `git rm`/`git mv` for the reviewer; no auto-execute).</constraint>
    <constraint source="project">Annotate the 9 Success Criteria from the 061 UAT report (met / owner-handoff / env-blocked / deferred); record the FR-15 spike outcome + operator permission-grant handoff + any deferred items in lessons-learned.</constraint>
