  <steps mode="directional">
    <step order="1" name="Verify all tasks complete">Read `TASK-INDEX.md`; confirm every task (001–061) is ✅ (or explicitly documented as deferred / owner-handoff). If any remain 🔲/🔄 unexpectedly, STOP and report.</step>
    <step order="2" name="Status → Complete + graduation">Update the project status to Complete; summarize the Phase 1–5 shipped scope + annotate the 9 spec Success Criteria as met / owner-handoff / env-blocked / deferred (from the 061 UAT report).</step>
    <step order="3" name="/test-diet gate">Invoke `/test-diet`; produce `notes/test-diet-report.md` (MAINTAIN keep / SCAFFOLDING `git rm` / AMBIGUOUS reviewer-judgment). Do NOT auto-execute the emitted commands.</step>
    <step order="4" name="Lessons-learned">Author `notes/lessons-learned.md` (shared-path edit discipline + conflict-check; code-directed Action + Binding; Job B trust chain; ADR-024 path-A related-to model; C-1 auto-file narrowing; RI-confidence hardcoded-0 fix; FR-15 spike outcome + escalation-fired + operator permission-grant handoff; publish-size trajectory vs ~49.63 MB; deferred items).</step>
    <step order="5" name="Reconcile + reset">Mark task 090 ✅ in `TASK-INDEX.md`; confirm full reconciliation; set `current-task.md` to "none — project complete".</step>
    <step order="6" name="Ready to merge">Confirm the project is complete and ready for `merge-to-master`; the wrap-up PR cites `notes/test-diet-report.md`.</step>
  </steps>

